---
source: tests/manual/flags_options.rs
expression: "Manual::new(\"demo\").option(Opt::new(\"output\").short(\"-o\").long(\"--output\").default_value(\"stdout\").help(\"where to write\"),).option(Opt::new(\"input\").short(\"-i\")).option(Opt::new(\"mode\").long(\"--mode\")).option(Opt::new(\"count\").help(\"number of items\")).without_version().render()"
---
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH DEMO 1
.SH NAME
demo
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdemo\fR [OPTIONS]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-output\fR=\fIoutput\fR [default: \fIstdout\fR]
where to write
.TP
\fB\-i\fR=\fIinput\fR
.TP
\fB\-\-mode\fR=\fImode\fR
.TP
=\fIcount\fR
number of items
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.TP
\fB0\fR
Successful program execution.
.TP
\fB1\fR
Unsuccessful program execution.
.TP
\fB101\fR
The program panicked.
